    "title": "MICROSERVICE-batchinsertion-List Hotel Loyalty Points Historys-v3-spec",
    "description": "The Hotel Loyalty Points History API allows users to access the historical records of loyalty points earned by customers within a hotel loyalty program. This endpoint provides a detailed list of all loyalty points transactions, enhancing customer experience by enabling loyalty program members to monitor their points accumulation and redemption history. Typical consumers of this API include hotel management systems and customer service applications, which utilize the data to provide better insights and service to guests. This API aims to strengthen customer relations and loyalty through transparency in rewards management.",
